        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 01 2022 22:41:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Convex</span></span></span><br>\n<span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Least stable</span></span></p>\n<p>All teeth engage bone at the same time. This causes the tendency for the blade to kick out during the cut.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 01 2022 22:56:57 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 01 2022 22:41:47 GMT+0000",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/orthopaedic-instruments/products/performance-series-blades/images/straight.png",
          "borderColor": "rgba(187,188,188,1)",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 01 2022 22:58:38 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "true"
        },
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 01 2022 22:42:02 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Straight</span></span></span><br>\n<span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #323232;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Better control characteristic&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n<p>Progressive engagement of cutting teeth. Reduces cutting force and kick out. Allows user better control of saw. Improved control allows faster cutting.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 01 2022 22:57:40 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
